---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="What is Limitra App Block and How Does It Work? - Digital Discipline" 
  description="Limitra App Block is a privacy-focused digital boundary and app blocker tool for Android, offering transparent usage logs and habit history analysis."
>
  <article class="product-page">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header text-center">
        <a href="/en" class="back-link">&larr; Home</a>
        <span class="article-meta">About the Product</span>
        <h1>What is Limitra App Block and How Does It Work?</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">A simple and transparent way to protect your pre-set digital boundaries, without pushing your willpower.</p>
      </header>

      <!-- How it Works Steps -->
      <section class="how-it-works-grid">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <h3>Select Applications</h3>
          <p>Identify the social media, entertainment, or short video apps that distract you the most or whose usage you want to control.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <h3>Set a Daily Limit</h3>
          <p>Determine how much time you want to allocate for selected apps daily (for example, a total of 45 minutes).</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <h3>Firm Behavioral Friction</h3>
          <p>When your time is up, Limitra App Block restricts access to the app for the day. It draws firm boundaries instead of easily ignored soft warnings.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Timeline Section -->
      <section class="split-section">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="/urun-gorselleri/zaman-tuneli.png" alt="Limitra App Block Timeline" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="section-badge">Transparency & Tracking</span>
          <h2>Boundaries are not just set, they are also tracked</h2>
          <p>
            One of the biggest problems in screen time management is not remembering clearly what happened during the day. When was an app restricted, when was the limit reached, when did the lock screen activate? Limitra App Block’s Timeline section displays these important events in a simple and understandable flow.
          </p>
          <p>
            This feature is especially valuable for parents. You can see which apps on your child's phone are restricted, when the limits are activated, and whether the protection is working. The goal is not stealthy tracking; it is to make digital rules set at home more transparent and understandable.
          </p>
          <p>
            While many countries around the world are trying to bring firmer limits to phone and social media use in schools, a similar need arises for families: clear, visible, and discussable boundaries instead of vague warnings. Limitra App Block supports this process not with complex reports, but with a simple time flow that anyone can understand.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Discipline Summary Section -->
      <section class="split-section reverse">
        <div class="split-image">
          <img src="/urun-gorselleri/disiplin.png" alt="Limitra App Block Discipline Summary & 100-Day History" />
        </div>
        <div class="split-content">
          <span class="section-badge">Visual Progress</span>
          <h2>Seeing your progress makes it easier to stick to your boundaries</h2>
          <p>
            Changing digital habits is often not possible just by saying "I should use it less". Studies on human behavior show that setting goals, regularly tracking behavior, and visually noticing progress can support motivation. Limitra App Block’s Discipline Summary is therefore not just a statistics screen; it allows the user to see how well they stick to their boundaries.
          </p>
          <p>
            The 21-day summary quickly shows recent successes and missed days. The 100-day history reveals the bigger picture: In which periods were you more consistent, on which days was the limit breached, and how did the habit change over time? Green boxes represent success, red boxes represent missed days, and the blue box represents the active day.
          </p>
          <p>
            This visual tracking provides a small but powerful awareness to the user. Because when progress is visible, continuing the behavior becomes more meaningful so that the streak is not broken. Limitra App Block’s goal is not to blame the user, but to help them see their decisions, progress, and discipline more concretely.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Privacy & Security -->
      <section class="privacy-section">
        <div class="text-center privacy-intro">
          <h2>Privacy & Security Approach</h2>
          <p>You do not need to compromise your privacy to build digital discipline.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-grid">
          <div class="privacy-card">
            <h3>On-Device Data Processing</h3>
            <p>Sensitive data, such as which app you use and for how long, is not sent to cloud servers. All data streams are processed and stored entirely on your device.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="privacy-card">
            <h3>Only Required Permissions</h3>
            <p>The app only requests the Android system permissions (such as accessibility or usage data access permissions) necessary to check boundaries and perform blocking.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="privacy-card">
            <h3>Ad-Free & Minimal</h3>
            <p>It does not contain external ads or unnecessary notifications that distract you. It is a completely independent digital discipline tool.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA Box -->
      <footer class="product-cta">
        <div class="info-box">
          <div class="info-box-title">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
              <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
              <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"></line>
            </svg>
            Try It Now
          </div>
          <p>
            Limitra App Block is available on the Google Play Store for Android devices. Download now, set your own boundaries, and start protecting your digital focus.
          </p>
          <div style="margin-top: 1.25rem;">
            <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.gardiyan.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">Review on Google Play Store</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .product-page {
    padding-top: var(--space-8);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .page-header {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-16) auto;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .article-meta {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  /* How it Works Steps */
  .how-it-works-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .step-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    position: relative;
  }

  .step-num {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent-soft);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .step-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Split Section */
  .split-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    background-color: var(--bg-secondary);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
  }

  .split-image {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .split-image img {
    max-width: 100%;
    max-height: 460px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
  }

  .split-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .section-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .split-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .split-content p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .split-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Privacy Section */
  .privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .privacy-intro {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-8) auto;
  }

  .privacy-intro h2 {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .privacy-intro p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .privacy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .privacy-card {
    background-color: var(--bg-primary);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .privacy-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .privacy-card h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
  }

  .privacy-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .product-cta {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* Responsive Design */
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .how-it-works-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }

    .split-section {
      grid-template-columns: 0.9fr 1.1fr;
      gap: var(--space-12);
      padding: var(--space-12);
    }

    .split-section.reverse {
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    }

    .split-section.reverse .split-image {
      order: 2;
    }

    .split-section.reverse .split-content {
      order: 1;
    }

    .privacy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
